        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>PDQ Heavy Duty Door Saver Arm</b>\r\n<p>\r\nFits <a href=\"/products/commercial-ada-compliant-full-cover-surface-mount-closer-american-eagle-5100\"><b>American Eagle 5100 Door Closers</b></a> and <a href=\"/products/ada-compliant-delayed-action-handicap-door-closer-american-eagle-5141-bcpa\"><b>American Eagle 5141 Delayed Action Handicap Door Closer</b></a> (for 11 mm closer pinion shaft). \r\n</p>\r\n<p><b>Parallel Arm Mount Only (door closer mounted on the push side of the door)</b>\r\n</p>\r\n<p>\r\nHeavy duty rigid arm assembly and soffit plate with field reversible dead stop. Normally used on outswing doors that are subjected to wind. The built in closer arm dead stop protects the closer, door and frame from damage when the door is swung open by the wind. \r\n</p>\r\n<p>\r\n Available in 3 painted finishes of Aluminum, Dark Bronze or Gold and 2 plated finishes, Polished Brass or Satin Chrome.\r\n</p>",
